                                "sense_id": "2cb3bf24-9728-341b-a309-2d867bb526c3",
                                "text": "\"I did!\" She had reached the barricades, and leaned over them languorously. \"I can't take all the credit, though, just, you know, most of it.\" She folded her arms over the edge, and kicked back both of her feet again and again. \"Somebody once told me I have a mind like a steel trap.\""
